Basically they have the same kinds of attacks as the regular mind flayer,
just harder. They make you forget things like discoveries and level maps.
Just use anything you can to kill it from a distance, don't let it come
next to you. Attack wands and spells, daggers, darts, arrows..
A wand of death is a quick way to handle it. Also, it seems to me that
they are quite vulnerable to cold attacks.
Oh, and if you have a can of grease handy, it is a good idea to grease
your helmet. It sometimes protects from the mindflaying attack if the
sucker manages to get next to you.

